f 3,080 real customer messages scores all three.\\n\\n## Rules\\n- Allowed: read weights, run the scorer and the encoder on inputs you choose,\\n  reason about directions and units, change any scorer weights, add the extra module.\\n- Not allowed: gradient descent, optimizers, any training or fitting loop,\\n  least squares, logistic regression or any solver fitted to data. Every weight\\n  you write must come from your own reasoning. Computing a direction as a\\n  difference of means of marker vectors of messages YOU wrote is allowed;\\n  fitting to the evidence labels is not. Checking with forward passes is fine.\\n- Write `NOTES.md`: what you changed and why, in under 200 words.\",\"stderr\":\"\",\"interrupted\":false,\"isImage\":false,\"noOutputExpected\":false},\"tool_result_meta\":[{\"id\":\"toolu_01UfArJgsxX3g8NatDmujmFR\",\"permission_decision\":{\"decision\":\"accept\",\"source\":\"config\",\"reason_type\":\"subcommandResults\"}}]}\n{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-5-5\",\"id\":\"msg_011CgiQJLJ1m6aV8UDZdFXfq\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_01CKJphaXw3cW1gBoxdrDHc7\",\"name\":\"Bash\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"cat scorer.py embed.py evidence.csv && head -c 3000 editor.log; echo; tail -c 3000 editor.log\",\"description\":\"Show scorer, encoder script, evidence, and log ends\"},\"caller\":{\"type\":\"direct\"}}],\"container\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":4179,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":52925,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":4179},\"output_tokens\":17,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"global\",\"speed\":\"standard\"},\"input_transformations\":[],\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"a707594b-2f0c-4709-bdbf-8d1664be31da\",\"uuid\":\"7f102eb6-37a8-43