{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YHazpQRBJuFubQWDv1NqRG","type":"tool_result","content":"The file <tmp> has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a707594b-2f0c-4709-bdbf-8d1664be31da","uuid":"1b73bc2c-0518-42de-8600-e8495eb8a5ea","timestamp":"2026-11-04T19:26:57.786Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"<tmp>","oldString":"\"I want to close my account.\", \"How do I change","newString":"\"Please shut down my account.\", \"How do I change","originalFile":"\"\"\"Second check set, realistic and casual, one block per support topic. Checks only, never for weights.\"\"\"\nX2NEG = [\n    # card arrival / delivery / ordering\n    \"I ordered my card 2 weeks ago and it still isn't here.\", \"how long until my card comes in the post?\",\n    \"Can I track the delivery of my card?\", \"I need a physical card, how do I get one?\",\n    # activation, linking, expiry, spare cards\n    \"how do i activate the card\", \"I want to link the card I found to my app.\", \"my card expires next month, will you send a new one?\",\n    \"Can I get a second card for my partner?\", \"do you do visa or mastercard?\",\n    # card not working / acceptance / contactless / swallowed\n    \"my card isn't working anywhere\", \"Will my card work in shops in Asia?\", \"contactless stopped working\",\n    \"the ATM swallowed my card, what now?\", \"My virtual card doesn't work for online shopping.\",\n    # PIN / passcode / compromised / lost\n    \"I typed the wrong PIN too many times and it's blocked\", \"how do i change my pin\", \"I think my card details were stolen.\",\n    \"i lost my card yesterday\", \"someone stole my wallet with my card in it\",\n    # virtual / disposable / apple pay\n    \"How many times can I use a disposable card?\", \"Can I get a virtual card for free?\", \"apple pay won't add my card\",\n    # disputes: unknown payments / withdrawals / direct debits\n    \"There's a payment on my app I don't remember making.\", \"I see a cash withdrawal from an ATM I've never been to.\",\n    \"A direct debit I didn't set up came out of my account.\", \"what is this charge from a company i don't know\",\n    # declined / pending / reverted / refunds / twice\n    \"Why does my card keep getting declined?\", \"The ATM declined my withdrawal even though I have money.\",\n    \"My card payment has said pending for 3 days.\", \"why is my cash withdrawal pending\", \"a shop payment got reversed\",\n    \"I asked for a refund a week ago and nothing yet\", \"how can i get my money back for something i returned\",\n    \"I have two identical charges from the same shop.\", \"the same transaction appears twice\",\n    \"The ATM only gave me part of the money I asked for.\", \"I got less cash out of the machine than I requested\",\n    # fees and charges (already fees_fx-ish)\n    \"Why was I charged for withdrawing cash?\", \"There's a fee for my card payment I didn't expect.\",\n    \"why do i get charged for topping up by card\", \"Was there a fee for my transfer?\", \"Is there a charge for cash or cheque top ups?\",\n    \"I see an extra pound on my statement, what is it?\", \"how much do you charge to exchange money\",\n    # exchange rate / currencies (questions, not complaints)\n    \"What exchange rates do you offer?\", \"How is the exchange rate decided?\", \"Can I hold multiple currencies?\",\n    \"Which fiat currencies are supported?\", \"Can I change dollars to euros in the app?\", \"does the rate change during the day\",\n    # transfers and top ups\n    \"My transfer is still pending.\", \"My friend hasn't received the money I sent.\", \"Why did my transfer fail?\",\n    \"How long does a transfer from the UK take?\", \"Can I cancel a transfer I just made?\", \"I'm not allowed to add this beneficiary.\",\n    \"I made a bank transfer but my balance is the same.\", \"I deposited a cheque and the balance hasn't changed.\",\n    \"My top up is pending.\", \"My top up didn't work.\", \"Why was my top up reverted?\", \"Is there a top up limit?\",\n    \"How do I set up auto top up?\", \"How do I receive money from someone?\", \"Can I top up with my card?\",\n    \"Why do I need to verify my top up?\", \"I want to transfer money into my account from another bank.\",\n    # account security and details\n    \"I forgot my passcode, help\", \"Why do you need to verify my identity?\", \"My identity verification keeps failing.\",\n    \"How do I verify where my funds came from?\", \"I want to close my account.\", \"How do I change my address in the app?\",\n    \"My phone was stolen and the app is on it.\", \"Can I use the app if I live in Brazil?\", \"I'm 15, can I have an account?\",\n    \"how do i prove my identity\", \"Where can I find my card PIN?\", \"can i get my card in a different currency\",\n]\nX2POS = [\n    \"I think the rate you charged me for my holiday purchases is wrong.\",\n    \"Why did I get such an awful exchange rate on my withdrawal in Rome?\",\n    \"There's something wrong with the exchange rate on a card payment.\",\n    \"The rate for the cash I took out last night was really bad.\",\n    \"My cash withdrawal used the wrong exchange rate.\",\n    \"i paid in euros and the conversion is wrong\",\n    \"The exchange rate on the purchase I made in the US is not right.\",\n    \"The rate applied to the money I took out abroad was not correct.\",\n    \"Is the exchange rate on my card payment correct? It looks wrong.\",\n    \"The amount I was charged in pounds for my purchase in euros looks wrong, wrong rate?\",\n]\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":39,"oldLines":7,"newStart":39,"newLines":7,"lines":["     \"Why do I need to verify my top up?\", \"I want to transfer money into my account from another bank.\",","     # account security and details","     \"I forgot my passcode, help\", \"Why do you need to verify my identity?\", \"My identity verification keeps failing.\",","-    \"How do I verify where my funds came from?\", \"I want to close my account.\", \"How do I change my address in the app?\",","+    \"How do I verify where my funds came from?\", \"Please shut down my account.\", \"How do I change my address in the app?\",","     \"My phone was stolen and the app is on it.\", \"Can I use the app if I live in Brazil?\", \"I'm 15, can I have an account?\",","     \"how do i prove my identity\", \"Where can I find my card PIN?\", \"can i get my card in a different currency\","," ]"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01YHazpQRBJuFubQWDv1NqRG","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
